  <ProductDescription ID="87829506" LongDesc="&lt;b&gt;Dual-Band Wi-Fi for Faster, Smoother Connections&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Experience faster connections with dual-band Wi-Fi. The 2.4GHz band ensures stable, long-range signals for daily tasks, while the 5GHz band delivers up to 433 Mbps for smooth gaming and HD streaming.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Compact Design, Easy to Carry&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The WU650's sleek, compact design makes it easy to carry anywhere. Its small size won't block neighboring USB ports, providing hassle-free compatibility for all your needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Plug &amp; Play&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;With built-in drivers, the network card automatically adapts to your system and installs itself. Simply plug in, and enjoy seamless internet access with ease.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Share Wi-Fi Anywhere with AP Mode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;With the WU650, you can turn your desktop or laptop's wired internet connection into a Wi-Fi hotspot, allowing devices like smartphones and tablets to easily connect and get online.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Broad System Compatibility for Every User&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Wi-Fi adapter supports a wide range of operating systems, including Windows, macOS, and Linux, catering to the needs of all users. Enjoy stable and fast internet connections across various platforms." ManualPDFSize="0" ManualPDFURL="" MiddleDesc="" PDFSize="494074" PDFURL="https://objects.icecat.biz/objects/mmo_101303752_1659453044_5456_4583.pdf" ShortDesc="650Mbps, Wi-Fi, Dual Band, USB Adapter, Model: WU650, Black" URL="https://www.cudy.com/en-eu/products/wu650-2-0?_pos=2&amp;_psq=WU650&amp;_ss=e&amp;_v=1.0#features" WarrantyInfo="" langid="1"/>
